# Code-first

**Owner:** docs/CODE-FIRST.md

- If it must be done twice, put it in the repo as code or a contract.
- Docs explain why and link; do not grow a second how-tree beside scripts/infra/workflows/skills.
- CI must call the same check entrypoints as local.
- Portal-only steps are debt; inventory or script them (docs/ops/integrations-as-code.md).
